# =============================================================================
# Home Decor PLP Extraction — .gitignore
# =============================================================================
# This repo root doubles as the live working directory for ongoing extraction
# sessions, so it accumulates a lot of transient scratch/debug output that was
# never meant to be committed. This file is deliberately conservative: it
# blocks known junk categories, but the authoritative control on what gets
# published is the explicit `git add` path list used at commit time (see
# README.md "Repository Structure") rather than this file alone.

# ---- Secrets / environment -------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
token.json
cookies.json
cookies.txt

# ---- Claude Code local/session state ---------------------------------------
# settings.local.json holds machine-specific absolute paths and permission
# grants for this workstation; it is not portable and not meant to be shared.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.local.json

# ---- Python -----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
.venv - Copy/
.mypy_cache/
.mypy_cache - Copy/
.pytest_cache/
.pytest_cache - Copy/
.ruff_cache/
.ruff_cache - Copy/
data - Copy/

# ---- Node -------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# ---- OS / editor --------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
nul

# ---- Excel lock files ---------------------------------------------------------
~$*.xlsx
~$*.xlsm

# ---- Backups / ad hoc snapshots ---------------------------------------------
_backup_*/

# ---- Pipeline: scraping cache & scratch (not deliverable data) --------------
# Keep the structured extraction results (*.json), scripts (*.py) and docs
# (*.md, *.sha256) inside pipeline/*_json_archive/ and pipeline/final_list_*/
# — those are the real, reviewed data. Everything below is raw fetch cache,
# intermediate HTML/XML dumps, or debug scratch that regenerates on demand
# and was never meant to be version-controlled (some individual files exceed
# GitHub's 100MB hard limit).
pipeline/tmp/
pipeline/work/
pipeline/**/__pycache__/
pipeline/**/*.html
pipeline/**/*.xml
pipeline/**/*.xml.gz
pipeline/**/*.pkl
pipeline/**/*.png
pipeline/**/*.log
pipeline/**/*.gz
pipeline/**/*.pyc
pipeline/**/nul
pipeline/**/Users*Gyanendra*
pipeline/**/UsersGyanendra*
# Keep the one real ledger .txt (dispatched.txt); drop everything else loose.
pipeline/**/*.txt
!pipeline/**/dispatched.txt

# ---- Root-level research scratch (raw HTML/JSON dumps from past sessions) --
# These are not tracked because the deliverable is the *.claude/skills* rule
# modules, the pipeline/ extraction archives, and the curated category
# workbooks listed explicitly in the commit — not ad hoc fetch debris sitting
# at the project root. Nothing here is deleted; it simply isn't added to git.
*.html
*.xml
*.pkl
*.png
!docs/**/*.png
*.log
scratch_*.py
scratch_*.html
scratch_*.json
scratch_*.txt
scratchpad_*
out_*.txt
out1.txt
out2.txt
body.out
test.txt
C:UsersGYANEN~1AppDataLocalTempclaudelinks_home.txt

# Miscellaneous non-primary workbooks at project root (per project scope:
# only the category output workbooks + the company roster are tracked).
Companies_Link_Gyanendra_Updated.xlsm
new companies list77.xlsm
Home_Decor_Extraction_Batch1-8.xlsx
Test Performance.xlsx
Unassigned_Records_Report.csv

# Belt-and-suspenders: at the project ROOT only (not pipeline/, not docs/),
# no legitimate deliverable is ever a loose .json/.py/.txt file or a
# "scratch_*"/"scratchpad_*"-prefixed directory — every real deliverable at
# root is one of the tracked .xlsx workbooks or the files explicitly listed
# above. This catches one-off research-session debris (cat_*.json,
# navdump.json, dump_refine.py, jina_artgallery.txt, scratch_ajio/, etc.)
# without needing to name every past/future filename individually.
/*.json
/*.py
/*.txt
scratch_ajio/
